  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, you augment your martial prowess with the ability to use creations (spells). You prepare and cast gadgeteer creations using Wisdom as your creative ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Creation save DC</strong> = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Wisdom modifier</p>\n<p><strong>Creation Attack modifier</strong> = your proficiency bonus + your Wisdom modifier</p>\n<p>You know three tricks (cantrips) from the gadgeteer creation list. You learn additional tricks at higher levels. You prepare a number of creations equal to your Wisdom modifier + half your Expressionist level (rounded down, minimum 1). You regain all expended creation slots when you finish a long rest.</p>",
